data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Validated recipe — cctp@2\n_human-validated 2026-08-07 by farseen (github: FarseenSh)_\n_source: recipes/cctp/usdc-bridge-send.yaml_\n\n**Receipts** — what was actually run, on 2026-08-07, by farseen (github: FarseenSh)\n- checks: attest, test\n- chains exercised: base-sepolia, arbitrum-sepolia\n- on-chain:\n  - txHash: `0xd4b4e6395f52ad726dd6062e7a7ec47a2d3a7875d36f20fbb154cde756a3d0f5` — approve on base-sepolia\n  - txHash: `0xb0db8b585460b086c405ef4fd2a035e130b04b81729feb997235bcd6162421e6` — approve on base-sepolia\n  - txHash: `0xdba9da61c7873b092113dd2ad6a81b4104cd7d47264515ff0ae7aee2e11a0f74` — burn (depositForBurn) on base-sepolia\n  - txHash: `0xcd869bb6b169d29e9586380a90af688231b1fdbe9bc9db00e0081c53a7bd2dab` — mint (receiveMessage) on arbitrum-sepolia\n  - txHash: `0x14600541732355b12bf44d1370cbfdd14dd16bba42b14b5d79d7c87ad26c3080` — attestation probe on base-sepolia\n- gas: see `gas_notes` — the measured figures live there with their conditions, and a receipt that restated them without those conditions would be a number without its composition.\n- what these receipts do NOT prove: ⚠ ONE round trip is receipted — approve, burn on base-sepolia, mint on arbitrum-sepolia. The banner says `both tiers`; the SECOND tier's transaction hashes are NOT in the records. It was observed during validation and its hashes were not written down, which is a different thing from not having happened — and a receipts block must say which of the two it is.\n\n# Recipe: cctp @2 :: usdc-bridge-send\n# STATUS: ✅ VALIDATED 2026-08-07 (UTC) by farseen (github: FarseenSh) — THE TRANSFER COMPLETED: 1.000000 USDC burned on Base Sepolia, minted on Arbitrum Sepolia — both legs RECEIPTED (see `receipts.on_chain`, re-verified by RPC 2026-08-20). A second, finalized-tier transfer was observed during validation and its hashes were NOT recorded; the `both tiers` claim is therefore not receipted and is narrowed here rather than repeated. 9 mistakes · 47 quotes · 24/24 keyless. Stamp commit f646501. (Bookkeeping repair 2026-08-12: the fields and the stamp commit below were always the record; this banner had not been flipped. No new validation — session log.)\nproject_id: \"cctp\"          # the PUBLISHER name — never carries the major\nversion_major: 2            # the coexisting-majors key. v1 is LIVE; see v1_legacy_note.\nversion: \"2\"                # CCTP protocol major. Not an npm semver — this is a protocol.\ntype: \"usdc-bridge-send\"\n\n# chains on which this recipe has been CONCRETELY TESTED (05- §2.2). Not the target list.\n# What the validation transfer actually reached. Mainnet addresses are verified on-chain by read\n# calls (stage 0) but NO MAINNET TRANSFER HAS EVER RUN — deployments is not chains.\nchains:\n  - base-sepolia\n  - arbitrum-sepolia\n\n# ── deployments ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# EVERY address verified on-chain 2026-08-07 and cross-checked against the others:\n# TokenMessenger.localMessageTransmitter() → MessageTransmitter, TokenMessenger.localMinter() →\n# TokenMinter, TokenMinter.localTokenMessenger() → TokenMessenger (both ends of the relation),\n# and MessageTransmitter.localDomain() → the `domain` stated here. Re-asserted by stage 0 of the\n# shadow test on every run. Domains are READ FROM THE CONTRACT, not from a docs table.\ndeployments:\n  ethereum:\n    domain: 0\n    chain_id: 1\n    token_messenger_v2: \"0x28b5a0e9C621a5BadaA536219b3a228C8168cf5d\"\n    message_transmitter_v2: \"0x81D40F21F12A8F0E3252Bccb954D722d4c464B64\"\n    token_minter_v2: \"0xfd78EE919681417d192449715b2594ab58f5D002\"\n  base:\n    domain: 6\n    chain_id: 8453\n    token_messenger_v2: \"0x28b5a0e9C621a5BadaA536219b3a228C8168cf5d\"\n    message_transmitter_v2: \"0x81D40F21F12A8F0E3252Bccb954D722d4c464B64\"\n    token_minter_v2: \"0xfd78EE919681417d192449715b2594ab58f5D002\"\n  arbitrum:\n    domain: 3\n    chain_id: 42161\n    token_messenger_v2: \"0x28b5a0e9C621a5BadaA536219b3a228C8168cf5d\"\n    message_transmitter_v2: \"0x81D40F21F12A8F0E3252Bccb954D722d4c464B64\"\n    token_minter_v2: \"0xfd78EE919681417d192449715b2594ab58f5D002\"\n  base-sepolia:\n    domain: 6\n    chain_id: 84532\n    token_messenger_v2: \"0x8FE6B999Dc680CcFDD5Bf7EB0974218be2542DAA\"\n    message_transmitter_v2: \"0xE737e5cEBEEBa77EFE34D4aa090756590b1CE275\"\n    token_minter_v2: \"0xb43db544E2c27092c107639Ad201b3dEfAbcF192\"\n    usdc: \"0x036CbD53842c5426634e7929541eC2318f3dCF7e\"\n  arbitrum-sepolia:\n    domain: 3\n    chain_id: 421614\n    token_messenger_v2: \"0x8FE6B999Dc680CcFDD5Bf7EB0974218be2542DAA\"\n    message_transmitter_v2: \"0xE737e5cEBEEBa77EFE34D4aa090756590b1CE275\"\n    token_minter_v2: \"0xb43db544E2c27092c107639Ad201b3dEfAbcF192\"\n    usdc: \"0x75faf114eafb1BDbe2F0316DF893fd58CE46AA4d\"\n\n# ── working_example ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nworking_example:\n  code: |\n    // ── cctp-v2-bridge.ts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // CCTP v2, Base Sepolia (domain 6) → Arbitrum Sepolia (domain 3).\n    // Signatures: circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts @ a92a2b4e, src/v2/  [C1][C7]\n    import {\n      createPublicClient, createWalletClient, http, pad, parseAbi, erc20Abi,\n    } from 'viem'\n    import { privateKeyToAccount } from 'viem/accounts'\n    import { arbitrumSepolia, baseSepolia } from 'viem/chains'\n\n    const SRC_DOMAIN = 6, DST_DOMAIN = 3\n    const TOKEN_MESSENGER      = '0x8FE6B999Dc680CcFDD5Bf7EB0974218be2542DAA'\n    const MESSAGE_TRANSMITTER  = '0xE737e5cEBEEBa77EFE34D4aa090756590b1CE275'\n    const TOKEN_MINTER         = '0xb43db544E2c27092c107639Ad201b3dEfAbcF192'\n    const SRC_USDC             = '0x036CbD53842c5426634e7929541eC2318f3dCF7e'\n    const IRIS                 = 'https://iris-api-sandbox.circle.com'\n\n    const FINALITY_CONFIRMED = 1000            // the v2 fast path  [C6] — FEE-GATED, see below\n\n    const tokenMessengerAbi = parseAbi([\n      'function depositForBurn(uint256 amount, uint32 destinationDomain, bytes32 mintRecipient, address burnToken, bytes32 destinationCaller, uint256 maxFee, uint32 minFinalityThreshold)',\n    ])\n    const transmitterAbi = parseAbi([\n      'function receiveMessage(bytes message, bytes attestation) returns (bool)',\n    ])\n    const minterAbi = parseAbi([\n      'function getLocalToken(uint32 remoteDomain, bytes32 remoteToken) view returns (address)',\n    ])\n\n\n_… recipe truncated for budget — 56012 bytes total, full text at the source path above._\n_Continue it: `web3_fetch` with `cursor: \"recipe:cctp@2::usdc-bridge-send::body@4839\"` — each call returns the next slice and the next cursor until there is none._\n\n**Citations** (preserved through truncation — degrade bodies, never citations):\n- https://iris-api-sandbox.circle.com\n- https://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/src/v2/TokenMessengerV2.sol\n- https://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/src/v2/TokenMessengerV2.sol#L166\n- https://github.com/tradingstrategy-ai/web3-ethereum-defi/pull/1099\n- https://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/issues/105\n- https://iris-api.circle.com/v2/messages/6?transactionHash=0x14600541…\n- https://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/issues/111\n- https://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/src/v2/TokenMessengerV2.sol#L210\n- https://sepolia.base.org`.\n- https://iris-api.circle.com\n- https://developers.circle.com/cctp\n\n---\n\n### cctp@v2::BaseTokenMessengerTest::testMIN_FEE_MULTIPLIER\n`cctp@v2` · repo:a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729 · as_of 2026-06-18T21:33:07Z\nhttps://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/test/v2/BaseTokenMessenger.t.sol#L320-L371\n\n```\nfunction testMIN_FEE_MULTIPLIER() public\nfunction testTransferOwnershipAndAcceptOwnership_succeeds(\nfunction testTransferOwnership_revertsOnNonOwner(\nfunction testAcceptOwnership_revertsOnNonPendingOwner(\nfunction testTransferOwnershipWithoutAcceptingThenTransferToNewOwner_succeeds(\n(5 units in…\n```\n\n### cctp@v2::BaseTokenMessengerTest::testRescuable\n`cctp@v2` · repo:a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729 · as_of 2026-06-18T21:33:07Z\nhttps://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/test/v2/BaseTokenMessenger.t.sol#L373-L413\n\n```\nfunction testRescuable(\nfunction testDenylistable(\nfunction _addLocalMinter(\n(3 units in this chunk)\n```\n\n### cctp@v2::BaseTokenMessengerTest::testAddRemoteTokenMessenger_revertsOnExistingRemoteTokenMessenger\n`cctp@v2` · repo:a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729 · as_of 2026-06-18T21:33:07Z\nhttps://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/test/v2/BaseTokenMessenger.t.sol#L119-L151\n\n```\nfunction testAddRemoteTokenMessenger_revertsOnExistingRemoteTokenMessenger(\nfunction testAddRemoteTokenMessenger_revertsOnZeroAddress(\nfunction testAddRemoteTokenMessenger_revertsOnNonOwner(\n(3 units in this chunk)\n```\n\n### cctp@v1::TokenMessengerTest::testRemoveLocalMinter_revertsOnNonOwner\n`cctp@v1` · repo:a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729 · as_of 2026-06-18T21:33:07Z\nhttps://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/test/TokenMessenger.t.sol#L1056-L1111\n\n```\nfunction testRemoveLocalMinter_revertsOnNonOwner() public\nfunction testRescuable(\nfunction testTransferOwnershipAndAcceptOwnership() public\nfunction testTransferOwnershipWithoutAcceptingThenTransferToNewOwner(\nfunction _addLocalMinter(\n(5 units in this chunk)\n```\n\n### cctp@v2::BaseTokenMessengerTest::testRemoveLocalMinter_revertsIfNoLocalMinterSet\n`cctp@v2` · repo:a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729 · as_of 2026-06-18T21:33:07Z\nhttps://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/test/v2/BaseTokenMessenger.t.sol#L240-L280\n\n```\nfunction testRemoveLocalMinter_revertsIfNoLocalMinterSet() public\nfunction testRemoveLocalMinter_revertsOnNonOwner(address _notOwner) public\nfunction testSetFeeRecipient_revertsOnNonOwner(\nfunction testSetFeeRecipient_revertsIfFeeRecipientIsZeroAddress() public\n+2 more units in this chunk\n```\n\n### cctp@v2::TokenMessengerV2Test::setUpBaseTokenMessenger\n`cctp@v2` · repo:a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729 · as_of 2026-06-18T21:33:07Z\nhttps://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/test/v2/TokenMessengerV2.t.sol#L150-L188\n\n```\nfunction setUpBaseTokenMessenger() internal override returns (address)\nfunction createBaseTokenMessenger(\nfunction testStorageSlots_hasAGapForDenylistableAdditions() public view\n(3 units in this chunk)\n```\n\n### cctp@v2::BaseTokenMessengerTest::testRemoveRemoteTokenMessenger_succeeds\n`cctp@v2` · repo:a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729 · as_of 2026-06-18T21:33:07Z\nhttps://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/test/v2/BaseTokenMessenger.t.sol#L153-L193\n\n```\nfunction testRemoveRemoteTokenMessenger_succeeds(\nfunction testRemoveRemoteTokenMessenger_revertsOnNoTokenMessengerSet(\nfunction testRemoveRemoteTokenMessenger_revertsOnNonOwner(\n(3 units in this chunk)\n```\n\n### cctp@v2::BaseTokenMessengerTest::testAddLocalMinter_succeeds\n`cctp@v2` · repo:a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729 · as_of 2026-06-18T21:33:07Z\nhttps://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/test/v2/BaseTokenMessenger.t.sol#L195-L238\n\n```\nfunction testAddLocalMinter_succeeds(address _localMinter) public\nfunction testAddLocalMinter_revertsIfZeroAddress() public\nfunction testAddLocalMinter_revertsIfAlreadySet(\nfunction testAddLocalMinter_revertsOnNonOwner(\nfunction testRemoveLocalMinter_succeeds(address _localMinter) public\n(5 units…\n```\n\n### cctp@v2::SetupRemoteResourcesV2Script::usdcRemoteContractAddress\n`cctp@v2` · repo:a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729 · as_of 2026-06-18T21:33:07Z\nhttps://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/scripts/v2/SetupRemoteResourcesV2.s.sol#L26-L83\n\n```\naddress private usdcRemoteContractAddress;\naddress private usdcContractAddress;\naddress private tokenMessengerV2ContractAddress;\naddress private tokenMinterV2ContractAddress;\nuint32 private remoteDomain;\nuint256 private tokenMessengerV2OwnerPrivateKey;\n+3 more units in this chunk\n```\n\n### cctp@v2::SetupRemoteResourcesV2Script::setUp\n`cctp@v2` · repo:a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729 · as_of 2026-06-18T21:33:07Z\nhttps://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/scripts/v2/SetupRemoteResourcesV2.s.sol#L84-L122\n\n```\nfunction setUp() public\nfunction run() public\n(2 units in this chunk)\n```"}],"structuredContent":{"intent":"integrate","recipe":{"project_id":"cctp","version":"2","recipe_type":"usdc-bridge-send","last_validated":"2026-08-07","validated_by":"farseen (github: FarseenSh)","receipts":{"validated_on":"2026-08-07","validated_by":"farseen (github: FarseenSh)","checks":["attest","test"],"chains_exercised":["base-sepolia","arbitrum-sepolia"],"on_chain":[{"kind":"txHash","hash":"0xd4b4e6395f52ad726dd6062e7a7ec47a2d3a7875d36f20fbb154cde756a3d0f5","role":"approve","chain":"base-sepolia","block":"45178019"},{"kind":"txHash","hash":"0xb0db8b585460b086c405ef4fd2a035e130b04b81729feb997235bcd6162421e6","role":"approve","chain":"base-sepolia","block":"45178599"},{"kind":"txHash","hash":"0xdba9da61c7873b092113dd2ad6a81b4104cd7d47264515ff0ae7aee2e11a0f74","role":"burn (depositForBurn)","chain":"base-sepolia","block":"45178600"},{"kind":"txHash","hash":"0xcd869bb6b169d29e9586380a90af688231b1fdbe9bc9db00e0081c53a7bd2dab","role":"mint (receiveMessage)","chain":"arbitrum-sepolia","block":"295769074"},{"kind":"txHash","hash":"0x14600541732355b12bf44d1370cbfdd14dd16bba42b14b5d79d7c87ad26c3080","role":"attestation probe","chain":"base-sepolia","block":"45177027"}],"gas":"see `gas_notes` — the measured figures live there with their conditions, and a receipt that restated them without those conditions would be a number without its composition.","what_the_receipts_do_NOT_prove":"⚠ ONE round trip is receipted — approve, burn on base-sepolia, mint on arbitrum-sepolia. The banner says `both tiers`; the SECOND tier's transaction hashes are NOT in the records. It was observed during validation and its hashes were not written down, which is a different thing from not having happened — and a receipts block must say which of the two it is."},"body":"# Recipe: cctp @2 :: usdc-bridge-send\n# STATUS: ✅ VALIDATED 2026-08-07 (UTC) by farseen (github: FarseenSh) — THE TRANSFER COMPLETED: 1.000000 USDC burned on Base Sepolia, minted on Arbitrum Sepolia — both legs RECEIPTED (see `receipts.on_chain`, re-verified by RPC 2026-08-20). A second, finalized-tier transfer was observed during validation and its hashes were NOT recorded; the `both tiers` claim is therefore not receipted and is narrowed here rather than repeated. 9 mistakes · 47 quotes · 24/24 keyless. Stamp commit f646501. (Bookkeeping repair 2026-08-12: the fields and the stamp commit below were always the record; this banner had not been flipped. No new validation — session log.)\nproject_id: \"cctp\"          # the PUBLISHER name — never carries the major\nversion_major: 2            # the coexisting-majors key. v1 is LIVE; see v1_legacy_note.\nversion: \"2\"                # CCTP protocol major. Not an npm semver — this is a protocol.\ntype: \"usdc-bridge-send\"\n\n# chains on which this recipe has been CONCRETELY TESTED (05- §2.2). Not the target list.\n# What the validation transfer actually reached. Mainnet addresses are verified on-chain by read\n# calls (stage 0) but NO MAINNET TRANSFER HAS EVER RUN — deployments is not chains.\nchains:\n  - base-sepolia\n  - arbitrum-sepolia\n\n# ── deployments ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# EVERY address verified on-chain 2026-08-07 and cross-checked against the others:\n# TokenMessenger.localMessageTransmitter() → MessageTransmitter, TokenMessenger.localMinter() →\n# TokenMinter, TokenMinter.localTokenMessenger() → TokenMessenger (both ends of the relation),\n# and MessageTransmitter.localDomain() → the `domain` stated here. Re-asserted by stage 0 of the\n# shadow test on every run. Domains are READ FROM THE CONTRACT, not from a docs table.\ndeployments:\n  ethereum:\n    domain: 0\n    chain_id: 1\n    token_messenger_v2: \"0x28b5a0e9C621a5BadaA536219b3a228C8168cf5d\"\n    message_transmitter_v2: \"0x81D40F21F12A8F0E3252Bccb954D722d4c464B64\"\n    token_minter_v2: \"0xfd78EE919681417d192449715b2594ab58f5D002\"\n  base:\n    domain: 6\n    chain_id: 8453\n    token_messenger_v2: \"0x28b5a0e9C621a5BadaA536219b3a228C8168cf5d\"\n    message_transmitter_v2: \"0x81D40F21F12A8F0E3252Bccb954D722d4c464B64\"\n    token_minter_v2: \"0xfd78EE919681417d192449715b2594ab58f5D002\"\n  arbitrum:\n    domain: 3\n    chain_id: 42161\n    token_messenger_v2: \"0x28b5a0e9C621a5BadaA536219b3a228C8168cf5d\"\n    message_transmitter_v2: \"0x81D40F21F12A8F0E3252Bccb954D722d4c464B64\"\n    token_minter_v2: \"0xfd78EE919681417d192449715b2594ab58f5D002\"\n  base-sepolia:\n    domain: 6\n    chain_id: 84532\n    token_messenger_v2: \"0x8FE6B999Dc680CcFDD5Bf7EB0974218be2542DAA\"\n    message_transmitter_v2: \"0xE737e5cEBEEBa77EFE34D4aa090756590b1CE275\"\n    token_minter_v2: \"0xb43db544E2c27092c107639Ad201b3dEfAbcF192\"\n    usdc: \"0x036CbD53842c5426634e7929541eC2318f3dCF7e\"\n  arbitrum-sepolia:\n    domain: 3\n    chain_id: 421614\n    token_messenger_v2: \"0x8FE6B999Dc680CcFDD5Bf7EB0974218be2542DAA\"\n    message_transmitter_v2: \"0xE737e5cEBEEBa77EFE34D4aa090756590b1CE275\"\n    token_minter_v2: \"0xb43db544E2c27092c107639Ad201b3dEfAbcF192\"\n    usdc: \"0x75faf114eafb1BDbe2F0316DF893fd58CE46AA4d\"\n\n# ── working_example ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nworking_example:\n  code: |\n    // ── cctp-v2-bridge.ts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // CCTP v2, Base Sepolia (domain 6) → Arbitrum Sepolia (domain 3).\n    // Signatures: circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts @ a92a2b4e, src/v2/  [C1][C7]\n    import {\n      createPublicClient, createWalletClient, http, pad, parseAbi, erc20Abi,\n    } from 'viem'\n    import { privateKeyToAccount } from 'viem/accounts'\n    import { arbitrumSepolia, baseSepolia } from 'viem/chains'\n\n    const SRC_DOMAIN = 6, DST_DOMAIN = 3\n    const TOKEN_MESSENGER      = '0x8FE6B999Dc680CcFDD5Bf7EB0974218be2542DAA'\n    const MESSAGE_TRANSMITTER  = '0xE737e5cEBEEBa77EFE34D4aa090756590b1CE275'\n    const TOKEN_MINTER         = '0xb43db544E2c27092c107639Ad201b3dEfAbcF192'\n    const SRC_USDC             = '0x036CbD53842c5426634e7929541eC2318f3dCF7e'\n    const IRIS                 = 'https://iris-api-sandbox.circle.com'\n\n    const FINALITY_CONFIRMED = 1000            // the v2 fast path  [C6] — FEE-GATED, see below\n\n    const tokenMessengerAbi = parseAbi([\n      'function depositForBurn(uint256 amount, uint32 destinationDomain, bytes32 mintRecipient, address burnToken, bytes32 destinationCaller, uint256 maxFee, uint32 minFinalityThreshold)',\n    ])\n    const transmitterAbi = parseAbi([\n      'function receiveMessage(bytes message, bytes attestation) returns (bool)',\n    ])\n    const minterAbi = parseAbi([\n      'function getLocalToken(uint32 remoteDomain, bytes32 remoteToken) view returns (address)',\n    ])\n","source_path":"recipes/cctp/usdc-bridge-send.yaml","requested_version":null,"exact_version_match":null,"body_truncated":true,"body_bytes":56012,"citations":["https://iris-api-sandbox.circle.com","https://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/src/v2/TokenMessengerV2.sol","https://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/src/v2/TokenMessengerV2.sol#L166","https://github.com/tradingstrategy-ai/web3-ethereum-defi/pull/1099","https://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/issues/105","https://iris-api.circle.com/v2/messages/6?transactionHash=0x14600541…","https://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/issues/111","https://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/src/v2/TokenMessengerV2.sol#L210","https://sepolia.base.org`.","https://iris-api.circle.com","https://developers.circle.com/cctp"],"citations_capped":false,"body_cursor":"recipe:cctp@2::usdc-bridge-send::body@4839"},"hits":[{"selector":"cctp@v2::BaseTokenMessengerTest::testMIN_FEE_MULTIPLIER","source_url":"https://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/test/v2/BaseTokenMessenger.t.sol#L320-L371","snippet":"function testMIN_FEE_MULTIPLIER() public\nfunction testTransferOwnershipAndAcceptOwnership_succeeds(\nfunction testTransferOwnership_revertsOnNonOwner(\nfunction testAcceptOwnership_revertsOnNonPendingOwner(\nfunction testTransferOwnershipWithoutAcceptingThenTransferToNewOwner_succeeds(\n(5 units in…","project":"cctp","version":"v2","version_defaulted":false,"last_validated":"2026-08-13T03:54:35Z","as_of":"2026-06-18T21:33:07Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729"},{"selector":"cctp@v2::BaseTokenMessengerTest::testRescuable","source_url":"https://github.com/circlefin/evm-cctp-contracts/blob/a92a2b4e7e6ef99bf0b05dca71780f5ec190e729/test/v2/BaseTokenMessenger.t.sol#L373-L413","snippet":"function testRescuable(\nfunction testDenylistable(\nfunction _addLocalMinter(\n(3 units in this chunk)","project":"cctp","version":"v2","version_defaulted":false,"last_validated":"2026-08-13T03:54:35Z","as_of":"2026-06-18T21:33:07Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_